    "created_at": "2016-03-08T15:36:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T15:36:42Z",
    "body": "Right.\n\nFor consistency making usemap work also in Shadow DOM would be good, but I wonder how rarely used feature it is. If very rarely, might be ok to limit its use to light DOM only. It is after all rather legacy feature.\n",
