    "created_at": "2016-03-08T18:05:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-08T18:05:24Z",
    "body": "I'm fine with either making it break in shadow trees, or making it only search the nearest containing tree.  Things shouldn't pierce shadow boundaries by default except in a few carefully-examined cases.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
