    "created_at": "2016-03-09T04:22:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-09T04:22:50Z",
    "body": "I agree with @annevk for consistency.\n\nIn term of the support cost, I think there is no much difference.\n1. Making it work only in a document tree\n2. Making it work in a node tree whose root tree is a document tree\n\nI guess 1 and 2 require almost the same engineering cost . Then, 2 would be reasonable.\n",
